      <p begin="01:43.670" end="01:48.890" ttm:agent="v1">Smoke until there's nothing remaining, I call it genocide</p>
      <p begin="01:48.890" end="01:52.200" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Phoney ass niggas plotting, whoa (I call it genocide)</p>
