      <p begin="02:14.690" end="02:18.970" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">I'ma fuck around, and Timmy Turner to the tippy top (tippy top)</p>
      <p begin="02:18.970" end="02:21.860" ttm:agent="v1">I wonder if these niggas really grip these Glocks</p>
