      <p begin="03:02.260" end="03:03.970" ttm:agent="v1">Constipated always making that hard shit</p>
      <p begin="03:03.970" end="03:05.750" ttm:agent="v1">Contemplating taking niggas real far, shit</p>
      <p begin="03:05.750" end="03:07.460" ttm:agent="v1">Things happen, niggas switch, you evolve with</p>
